(have a nagging suspicion that almost nobody ever clicks on them. \(In a Lobste.rs comment) Tj
T*
(Michael clarifies that "My rule of thumb is that my article should still make sense to the) Tj
T*
(reader even if they don't click any links". That works for me.\) This point about using your own) Tj
T*
(voice is crucial: Beginner software bloggers suffer from a mass delusion that you have to write) Tj
T*
(in a stiff, overly formal way for people to take you seriously [...] Just write the way you) Tj
